sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as React (WebView2)
    participant VC as TauriVaultClient (TS 适配器)
    participant CMD as Tauri Command (Rust)
    participant AUTH as AuthService (Rust)
    participant ITEM as ItemService (Rust)
    participant CLIP as ClipboardService (Rust + Win32)
    participant DB as SQLCipher (Rust)

    Note over UI,DB: 解锁 → 复制密码（DEK 全程不越 Rust 边界）
    UI->>VC: unlock(password)
    VC->>CMD: invoke('unlock_with_password', {password})
    CMD->>AUTH: verify + derive KEK-A + unwrap DEK
    AUTH->>DB: load keyslots
    AUTH-->>CMD: SessionState (status=unlocked, 无 DEK)
    CMD-->>VC: SessionState
    VC-->>UI: SessionState (前端仅持状态, 不持 DEK)

    UI->>VC: copyPassword(id)
    VC->>CMD: invoke('copy_password', {id})
    CMD->>ITEM: resolve item + visibility/authz
    ITEM->>DB: load encrypted field (password_enc)
    ITEM->>ITEM: decrypt in Rust memory with DEK
    ITEM->>CLIP: writeClipboard(plaintext)
    CLIP->>CLIP: 计算 SHA-256 摘要, 登记 TTL 定时清理
    CLIP->>W: OpenClipboard / SetClipboardData (Windows)
    CLIP-->>CMD: CopyReceipt {token, field, expiresAt, ttlMs}
    CMD-->>VC: CopyReceipt
    VC-->>UI: CopyReceipt (仅展示 Toast, 不持明文)

    Note over CLIP,W: 到期或锁定 → 仅当内容仍属密岛才清空
    CLIP->>W: GetClipboardSequenceNumber 比对 → 若被覆盖则跳过
